  {
    "start": 186.0,
    "end": 188.0,
    "text": "可以用一些三个party service"
  },
  {
    "start": 188.0,
    "end": 189.0,
    "text": "例如查一下IP address"
  },
  {
    "start": 189.0,
    "end": 191.0,
    "text": "是由哪个国家"
  },
  {
    "start": 191.0,
    "end": 195.0,
    "text": "可以加一些不同的customization和decoration"
  },
  {
    "start": 195.0,
    "end": 197.0,
    "text": "做好event"
  },
  {
    "start": 197.0,
    "end": 198.0,
    "text": "之后"
  },
  {
    "start": 198.0,
    "end": 199.0,
    "text": "将这个event"
  },
  {
    "start": 199.0,
    "end": 201.0,
    "text": "用一些三个party chat platform"
  },
  {
    "start": 201.0,
    "end": 202.0,
    "text": "例如是slack"
  },
  {
    "start": 202.0,
    "end": 204.0,
    "text": "去送给我们的security engineer"
  },
  {
    "start": 208.0,
    "end": 211.0,
    "text": "其中一个我们选择了一些chat platform的原因"
  },
  {
    "start": 211.0,
    "end": 214.0,
    "text": "就是我们发现如果我们用回传统email的方法"
  },
  {
    "start": 214.0,
    "end": 216.0,
    "text": "我们很容易会失去一些security event"
  },
  {
    "start": 216.0,
    "end": 218.0,
    "text": "整个emaster基础都没有了"
  },
  {
    "start": 218.0,
    "end": 220.0,
    "text": "而且这些thirdparty service"
  },
  {
    "start": 220.0,
    "end": 221.0,
    "text": "这些check的servicers"
  },
  {
    "start": 221.0,
    "end": 223.0,
    "text": "可以做到很多message"
  },
  {
    "start": 223.0,
    "end": 224.0,
    "text": "去迫私信"
  },
  {
    "start": 224.0,
    "end": 225.0,
    "text": "例如可以加一些按针"
  },
  {
    "start": 225.0,
    "end": 227.0,
    "text": "或者加一些比较方便的link"
  },
  {
    "start": 227.0,
    "end": 229.0,
    "text": "方便我们的security engineer"
  },
  {
    "start": 229.0,
    "end": 230.0,
    "text": "去查整个问题"
  },
  {
    "start": 230.0,
    "end": 232.0,
    "text": "所以我们可以做到一个"
  },
  {
    "start": 232.0,
    "end": 233.0,
    "text": "的意思"
  },
  {
    "start": 233.0,
    "end": 237.0,
    "text": "看来Guard 2可以帮助你"
  },
  {
    "start": 237.0,
    "end": 238.0,
    "text": "省了很多时间"
  },
  {
    "start": 238.0,
    "end": 240.0,
    "text": "而且很容易"
  },
  {
    "start": 240.0,
    "end": 242.0,
    "text": "是进行了很多不同的data source"
  },
  {
    "start": 242.0,
    "end": 245.0,
    "text": "其实你可否给一个实际的例子"
  },
  {
    "start": 245.0,
    "end": 248.0,
    "text": "或者可以如何帮助你的business operation"
  },
  {
    "start": 248.0,
    "end": 251.0,
    "text": "例如有一次我搭车回家的时候"
  },
  {
    "start": 251.0,
    "end": 254.0,
    "text": "我就在slack那里收到一个Guard duty的warning"
  },
  {
    "start": 254.0,
    "end": 256.0,
    "text": "就说有一个unauthorized"
  },
  {
    "start": 256.0,
    "end": 257.0,
    "text": "AWS console login"
  },
  {
    "start": 257.0,
    "end": 259.0,
    "text": "后来用我们的tool查"
  },
  {
    "start": 259.0,
    "end": 261.0,
    "text": "原来有个同事在家里debubt的时候"
  },
  {
    "start": 261.0,
    "end": 262.0,
    "text": "太心急"
  },
  {
    "start": 262.0,
    "end": 264.0,
    "text": "就不记得用公司的VPN"
  },
  {
    "start": 264.0,
